Steps:
Navigate to {{app_login_url}} and log in with 'demo@example.com'
Navigate to {{app_home_url}}
Click {{home_create_board_button}}
Enter the board name 'E2E Test Board' in {{dialog_board_name_input}}
Click {{dialog_create_submit_button}}

Navigate to {{app_board_url}} (using the boardId obtained in case-1)
Click {{board_add_list_button}}
Enter 'To Do' in {{list_title_input}}
Click {{list_save_button}}

Navigate to {{app_board_url}}
Click {{list_add_card_button}}
Type 'Buy milk' in {{card_title_input}}
Press the Enter key

Navigate to {{app_board_url}}
Open the 'Buy milk' card
Click {{card_due_date_button}}
Select tomorrow in {{date_picker}}

Navigate to {{app_board_url}}
Click {{card_menu_button}} on the 'Buy milk' card
Click {{menu_delete_item}}
Click {{dialog_confirm_delete_button}}

Navigate to {{app_board_url}}
Click {{list_menu_button}} on the 'To Do' list
Click {{menu_delete_item}}
Click {{dialog_confirm_delete_button}}

Navigate to {{app_account_settings_url}}
Click {{account_delete_button}}
Enter 'demo@example.com' in {{dialog_confirm_input}}
Click {{dialog_confirm_delete_button}}
